  <metadata>
    <desc>Extract from a real Apple Health export, relocated to a neutral origin and re-based to a fixed start time. Kept for the GPS artefact it contains; the surrounding geometry is genuine recorded movement. The track loses its fix, reappears 27 km away across a nine-minute gap, then snaps back in 59 seconds.</desc>
